  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under ASC 820 fair value measurement, the PWERM explicitly models multiple discrete future scenarios (IPO, acquisition, liquidation), determines payoffs to each equity class based on the liquidation waterfall, and weights results by estimated probabilities. This captures option-like payoff features of preferred stock.
